1
00:00:00,810 --> 00:00:02,770
(Leonard:)Would you please get that?

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:04,480
(Raj:)Of course.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:08,480
(Sheldon:)Why do you have to make things
so complicated?

4
00:00:10,480 --> 00:00:11,720
(Page:)Dr. Cooper?

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,650
(Leonard:)Yes.

6
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:14,450
(Woman at Door:)I'm Special Agent Page, FBI.

7
00:00:17,160 --> 00:00:22,290
You say you're Special
Agent Page, FBI.

8
00:00:22,290 --> 00:00:23,230
(Page:)Here's my I.D.

9
00:00:23,230 --> 00:00:25,180
(Sheldon:)And here is

10
00:00:25,180 --> 00:00:29,570
(Sheldon:)my Justice League
membership card.

11
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:33,300
(Sheldon:)But that doesn't
prove I know Batman.

12
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:38,080
(Page:)I just want to ask you a few
questions about Howard Wolowitz.

13
00:00:38,080 --> 00:00:40,180
(Sheldon:)Oh. All right.

14
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:42,950
(Sheldon:)I doubt anyone
would risk

15
00:00:42,950 --> 00:00:45,570
(Sheldon:)the stiff penalties for
impersonating a federal officer

16
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:47,990
(Sheldon:)just to ask questions about
a minor league engineer

17
00:00:47,990 --> 00:00:49,790
(Sheldon:)with an unresolved
Oedipal complex.

18
00:00:51,570 --> 00:00:52,590
(Woman at Door:)Thank you.

19
00:00:52,590 --> 00:00:55,990
(Sheldon:)For the record,
I truly support the FBI

20
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:57,830
(Sheldon:)in the mission
which is expressed

21
00:00:57,830 --> 00:00:59,100
(Sheldon:)through their motto...?

